[crw] This workspace has 60+ source files. A ranked structure map is available on demand: run `crw map <dir>` (tree-sitter symbols + PageRank) to see which files own which symbols BEFORE deep rg dives into unfamiliar territory. It is a stateless one-shot tool — use it when you need the shape of code you do not yet know. Keep rg for byte/text search, and use ast-grep (skill: $crw-ast-grep) for syntax-shape search and deterministic codemods.
